  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research for Agro-Ecology Network of Southern Africa (RAENS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The Action aims at increasing the STI capacities of Regional Centres of Excellence (RCoEs) in green transition related areas, in this case in the SADC Region. It will improve the RCoEs&#xbf; contributions to policy and decision-making processes, innovation ecosystems, business development as well provide support through services to relevant stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The targeted RCoEs are scientific, technical and/or research observatory, institute, university, association/academy, public authority, inter-governmental organisation, NGO or non-profit think tank, or network focussing on thematic areas such as biodiversity and forest; water; oceans; agro-ecological and sustainable agri-food systems; climate and disaster resilience; and energy. By doing so, the Action will contribute to Africa green transition promoting sustainable development&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
